<title>SPAIN: Spain's BCH sells a 20 pct stake in Zinc.</title>
<headline>Spain's BCH sells a 20 pct stake in Zinc.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Banco Central Hispano a 20 percent stake of Espanola del Zinc SA over the last two weeks, market sources said.</p>
<p>The bank, which remains with 30.8 percent of the zinc producer, did not comment.</p>
<p>At 1415 GMT, Espanola de Zinc fell 55 pesetas to 1,545.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
